('item-49', 'usr-seller-4', 'cat-fashion', 'Sepatu Nike Air Max 90 White Black Infrared Size 42.5 / US 9 Original', 'sepatu-nike-air-max-90-white-black-infrared-size-42-5', 'Sepatu sneakers ikonik era 90an Nike Air Max 90 OG. Unit bantalan udara Max Air di tumit yang legendaris memberi kenyamanan pegas di tiap langkah. Bahan upper kombinasi leather, mesh, dan panel TPU khas Air Max. Bodi bersih terawat 95% minim lipatan. Fullset dus original Nike Sportswear.', 1250000, 2199000, 1, 1100000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 470, 9, 61, 'DI Yogyakarta', 'Yogyakarta', 'Depok Sleman', '55281', 1, 'Pakuwon Mall Jogja / Plaza Ambarrukmo', '{"size":"42.5 EUR / US 9 / 27 CM","cushioning":"Visible Max Air Unit in Heel with Foam Midsole","outsole":"Rubber Waffle Outsole with Flex Grooves","colorway":"White / Black / Infrared"}', '2026-08-31T23:15:00Z', '2026-08-31T23:15:00Z'),
('item-50', 'usr-seller-9', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 5 5G 8GB / 256GB Mint SEIN Resmi Mulus Like New', 'samsung-galaxy-z-flip-5-5g-8gb-256gb-mint-sein', 'HP lipat compact Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 5 5G warna Mint garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia. Layar cover Flex Window 3.4 inci sangat berguna untuk balas pesan dan selfie kamera utama. Engsel Flex Hinge rapat tanpa celah lipatan. Kondisi 98% like new pemakaian cewek sangat hati-hati, layar lipat Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz no crease cacat. Fullset box kabel ori.', 8800000, 15999000, 1, 8300000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 620, 14, 85, 'Sumatera Utara', 'Medan', 'Medan Barat', '20111', 1, 'Sun Plaza Medan / Center Point Medan', '{"chipset":"Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy","ram":"8 GB","storage":"256 GB UFS 4.0","screens":"6.7\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz + 3.4\" Super AMOLED Flex Window","waterResistance":"IPX8 Water Resistant"}', '2026-09-01T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T08:00:00Z'),
('item-51', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-gadget', 'Xiaomi 13T 12GB / 256GB Leica Camera Alpine Blue Garansi Resmi TAM Mulus', 'xiaomi-13t-12gb-256gb-leica-camera-alpine-blue', 'Smartphone Xiaomi 13T hasil kolaborasi resmi dengan kamera legendaris Leica. Warna Alpine Blue dengan back cover BioComfort vegan leather yang sangat mewah dan nyaman digenggam. Lensa Leica Vario-Summicron 50MP menghasilkan tone warna Leica Authentic & Vibrant yang khas. Layar CrystalRes AMOLED 144Hz 2600 nits. Fullset charger cepat 67W asli.', 4950000, 6499000, 1, 4600000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 510, 10, 68, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza / Grand City Surabaya', '{"camera":"Leica Professional Optical 50MP Triple Camera with OIS","chipset":"MediaTek Dimensity 8200-Ultra (4nm)","display":"6.67\" 144Hz CrystalRes AMOLED HDR10+ Dolby Vision","charging":"67W Turbo Charging in 42 Mins"}', '2026-09-01T09:10:00Z', '2026-09-01T09:10:00Z'),
('item-52', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'iPad Air 5 64GB Wi-Fi Starlight Chip Apple M1 Mulus Fullset iBox', 'ipad-air-5-64gb-wi-fi-starlight-apple-m1', 'Apple iPad Air Generasi ke-5 chip Apple M1 kencang setara MacBook. Warna Starlight sangat elegan dan mewah. Layar Liquid Retina 10.9 inci dengan True Tone dan gamut warna P3. Kamera depan Ultra Wide 12MP dengan Center Stage otomatis mengikuti wajah saat video call. Kondisi mulus 97% pemakaian browsing & baca buku di rumah. Fullset dus dan adaptor 20W bawaan.', 7450000, 10999000, 1, 6950000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 440, 8, 59, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Cilandak', '12430', 1, 'Cilandak Town Square (CITOS) / One Belpark', '{"chipset":"Apple M1 Chip (8-Core CPU & 8-Core GPU)","storage":"64 GB Internal","display":"10.9\" Liquid Retina with True Tone and Antireflective Coating","touchId":"Top Button Touch ID"}', '2026-09-01T10:30:00Z', '2026-09-01T10:30:00Z'),
('item-53', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'Apple Watch Ultra 2 Titanium 49mm GPS Cellular Ocean Band Orange Resmi iBox', 'apple-watch-ultra-2-titanium-49mm-ocean-band-orange', 'Smartwatch petualang paling tangguh Apple Watch Ultra 2 casing Titanium 49mm garansi resmi iBox Indonesia. Layar Retina OLED Always-On 3000 nits paling terang di bawah terik matahari. Chip S9 SiP dengan gestur Double Tap inovatif dan GPS presisi frekuensi ganda (L1 dan L5). Baterai tahan hingga 36 jam (72 jam low power mode). Fullset dus kabel magnetic fast charger.', 11200000, 15999000, 1, 10500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 680, 13, 94, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Kebayoran Baru', '12130', 1, 'Gandaria City / Pacific Place SCBD', '{"caseSize":"49mm Aerospace-Grade Titanium","brightness":"3000 Nits Always-On Retina Display","connectivity":"GPS + Cellular LTE with Dual-Frequency GPS","waterResistance":"100m Water Resistant with Depth Gauge & Water Temp"}', '2026-09-01T11:45:00Z', '2026-09-01T11:45:00Z'),
('item-54', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-laptop', 'Dell XPS 13 Plus 9320 Intel Core i7-1360P 16GB / 512GB SSD OLED 3.5K Platinum', 'dell-xps-13-plus-9320-i7-1360p-16gb-512gb-oled', 'Laptop ultra-futuristik Dell XPS 13 Plus 9320 warna Platinum Silver. Desain minimalis tanpa sela dengan zero-lattice keyboard dan trackpad haptic kaca tanpa batas. Layar sentuh 13.4 inci OLED 3.5K (3456x2160) DisplayHDR 500 dengan warna hitam pekat tak tertandingi. Ditenagai prosesor Core i7-1360P 12 core bertenaga. Bobot hanya 1.23 kg. Unit mulus 97% terawat.', 16900000, 28500000, 1, 15800000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 430, 7, 62, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong', '40132', 1, 'Ciwalk Bandung / Paris Van Java', '{"processor":"Intel Core i7-1360P (12 Cores, up to 5.0 GHz)","ram":"16 GB LPDDR5 6000MHz","storage":"512 GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD","display":"13.4\" 3.5K (3456x2160) OLED Touch 400 nits 100% DCI-P3","weight":"1.23 Kg"}', '2026-09-01T12:50:00Z', '2026-09-01T12:50:00Z'),
('item-55', 'usr-seller-5', 'cat-laptop', 'Monitor Gaming LG UltraGear 27GP850-B 27" QHD Nano IPS 165Hz G-Sync Compatible', 'monitor-gaming-lg-ultragear-27gp850-b-27-qhd-nano-ips-165hz', 'Monitor gaming jawara LG UltraGear 27GP850-B ukuran 27 inci resolusi tajam QHD (2560x1440). Panel Nano IPS 1ms GtG dengan refresh rate 165Hz (overclock hingga 180Hz) dan cakupan warna DCI-P3 98% bersertifikasi VESA DisplayHDR 400. Kompatibel dengan NVIDIA G-Sync dan AMD FreeSync Premium. Layar bersih no dead pixel no backlight bleed parah. Stand ergonomis tilt/height/pivot lengkap dus asli.', 3950000, 6299000, 1, 3600000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 520, 11, 71, 'Banten', 'Tangerang Selatan', 'Serpong', '15310', 1, 'The Breeze BSD / AEON Mall BSD', '{"panel":"27 Inch QHD (2560 x 1440) Nano IPS 1ms GtG","refreshRate":"165Hz (O/C 180Hz) with G-Sync & FreeSync Premium","colorGamut":"DCI-P3 98% with VESA DisplayHDR 400","stand":"Height, Pivot, and Tilt Adjustable Stand"}', '2026-09-01T14:10:00Z', '2026-09-01T14:10:00Z'),
('item-56', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-kamera', 'Sony Alpha 7 IV (A7 IV / ILCE-7M4) Body Only SC 3.5k Garansi Sony Mulus 98%', 'sony-alpha-7-iv-ilce-7m4-body-only-sc-3-5k', 'Kamera hybrid full-frame profesional Sony A7 IV (ILCE-7M4). Sensor Exmor R CMOS 33MP dan prosesor BIONZ XR super kencang. Autofokus Real-time Eye AF untuk manusia, hewan, dan burung. Rekaman video 4K 60p 10-bit 4:2:2 All-Intra dengan profil warna S-Cinetone. Shutter count sangat rendah 3.500 shot pemakaian foto studio dalam ruangan. Sensor bening, karet kencang. Garansi resmi Sony Indonesia.', 26800000, 36999000, 1, 25500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, '2026-11-30T00:00:00Z', 1, 'ACTIVE', 710, 12, 96, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza Surabaya / Galaxy Mall', '{"sensor":"33.0 MP Full-Frame Exmor R Back-Illuminated CMOS","shutterCount":3500,"video":"4K 60p 10-bit 4:2:2 with S-Cinetone and S-Log3","stabilization":"5-Axis In-Body Image Stabilization 5.5 Stops"}', '2026-09-01T15:20:00Z', '2026-09-01T15:20:00Z'),
('item-57', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-kamera', 'Lensa Sony FE 24-70mm F2.8 GM (G Master) SEL2470GM Optik Bening No Jamur', 'lensa-sony-fe-24-70mm-f2-8-gm-sel2470gm', 'Lensa zoom standar kasta tertinggi Sony G Master FE 24-70mm f/2.8 GM. Ketajaman luar biasa dari ujung ke ujung pada semua rentang fokal dengan bokeh bulat creamy khas GM berkat 9 bilah aperture sirkular. Motor Direct Drive SSM senyap dan presisi. Optik 100% bening bebas jamur, debu mikro sangat minim wajar. Selalu disimpan di dry cabinet elektrik. Lengkap pouch, lens hood asli, dan filter UV Hoya.', 17200000, 27999000, 1, 16000000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 460, 8, 54, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Rungkut', '60293', 1, 'Galaxy Mall Surabaya / Pakuwon City', '{"focalLength":"24-70mm Full-Frame E-Mount","aperture":"Constant F2.8 Maximum Aperture","glass":"XA (Extreme Aspherical) Element with Nano AR Coating","filterSize":"82mm"}', '2026-09-01T16:15:00Z', '2026-09-01T16:15:00Z'),
('item-58', 'usr-seller-8', 'cat-kamera', 'GoPro HERO 12 Black Creator Edition Paket 3 Baterai Enduro + Media Mod Mulus', 'gopro-hero-12-black-creator-edition-paket-lengkap', 'Action camera flagship GoPro HERO 12 Black paket Creator Edition terlengkap. Mendukung perekaman video HDR 5.3K 60fps dan 4K 120fps dengan stabilisasi HyperSmooth 6.0 pemenang Emmy Award dan 360° Horizon Lock. Paket termasuk Media Mod (mikrofon directional + port 3.5mm), Volta Hand Grip baterai built-in + remote nirkabel, Light Mod lampu LED, dan total 3 buah baterai Enduro tahan dingin. Kondisi fisik 98% istimewa.', 5600000, 8499000, 1, 5100000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 520, 9, 63, 'Bali', 'Denpasar', 'Denpasar Selatan (Sanur)', '80227', 1, 'Icon Bali Sanur / Living World Denpasar', '{"resolution":"5.3K 60fps & 4K 120fps with HDR Video","stabilization":"HyperSmooth 6.0 with 360 Horizon Lock","accessories":"Volta Battery Grip, Media Mod, Light Mod, 3x Enduro Battery","waterproof":"10m Water Resistance Without Housing"}', '2026-09-01T17:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T17:00:00Z'),
